{"id":"32669b2743b45fb364aa4741b82e98443155ca3c","axis":"silent","repo":"astral-sh/ruff","sha":"32669b2743b45fb364aa4741b82e98443155ca3c","parsed":{"files":[{"path":"crates/ruff_benchmark/benches/ty_script.rs","lines":["@@ -21,6 +21,7 @@ fn setup_iteration(root: &SystemPath, uv: &SystemPath) -> ProjectDatabase {","     metadata.set_override_options(Options {","         project_manager: Some(ProjectManagerOptions {","             script: Some(RangedValue::cli(ScriptProjectManager::Uv)),","+            ..ProjectManagerOptions::default()","         }),","         ..Options::default()","     });"],"additions":1,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"crates/ty/docs/configuration.md","lines":["@@ -1121,10 +1121,49 @@ Defaults to `false`."," "," ## `project-manager`"," ","+### `project`","+","+The project manager to use for discovering the project's workspace and Python environment.","+","+This setting is in preview and may change between ty releases.","+","+- With `\"none\"` (the default), ty discovers the project and Python environment itself.","+- With `\"uv\"`, ty uses [uv](https://docs.astral.sh/uv/) to discover the workspace root,","+  Python environment, and dependency metadata. The environment must already be synchronized;","+  ty does not install project dependencies. uv may update the lockfile. This requires","+  uv 0.12.3 or newer.","+","+An explicit `TY_UV` takes precedence over this setting. If your editor marks the workspace","+as untrusted, ty discovers the project without running uv.","+","+**Default value**: `\"none\"`","+","+**Type**: `\"uv\" | \"none\"`","+","+**Example usage**:","+","+=== \"pyproject.toml\"","+","+    ```toml","+    [tool.ty.project-manager]","+    project = \"uv\"","+    ```","+","+=== \"ty.toml\"","+","+    ```toml","+    [project-manager]","+    project = \"uv\"","+    ```","+","+---","+"," ### `script`"," "," The project manager to use for scripts with PEP 723 inline metadata."," ","+This setting is in preview and may change between ty releases.","+"," - With `\"none\"` (the default), ty looks for imported packages in your Python environment.","   Install any third-party packages the script needs in that environment."," - With `\"uv\"`, each script gets its own Python environment. ty uses"],"additions":39,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"crates/ty/docs/environment.md","lines":["@@ -56,8 +56,9 @@ Python environment for each script with [inline metadata](https://peps.python.or"," When set to `1` or `true`, ty also uses uv to discover the workspace root and its Python"," environment."," ","-Set to `off` to disable all uv integration, including for scripts that set","-`project-manager.script = \"uv\"`. An explicit `TY_UV` takes precedence over ty configuration.","+Set to `off` to disable all uv integration, even when `project-manager.project` or","+`project-manager.script` is set to `\"uv\"`. An explicit `TY_UV` takes precedence over ty","+configuration."," "," ## Externally-defined variables"," "],"additions":3,"deletions":2,"truncated":false},{"path":"crates/ty/docs/rules.md","lines":["@@ -5252,12 +5252,12 @@ for how to add these declarations."," "," This rule is disabled by default and requires uv integration."," ","-For projects, enable uv workspace integration (`TY_UV=1`) and use an existing, synchronized","-environment. Running [`uv check`](https://docs.astral.sh/uv/reference/cli/#uv-check) synchronizes","-the environment automatically before invoking ty, unless `--no-sync` is passed. For these checks, ty","-reads the dependency graph and module ownership returned by `uv workspace metadata` without changing","-installed packages. uv may update the lockfile to match the current dependency declarations. uv","-0.12.3 or later is required.","+For projects, set `project-manager.project = \"uv\"` in your ty configuration and use an existing,","+synchronized environment. Running [`uv check`](https://docs.astral.sh/uv/reference/cli/#uv-check)","+synchronizes the environment automatically before invoking ty, unless `--no-sync` is passed. For","+these checks, ty reads the dependency graph and module ownership returned by `uv workspace metadata`","+without changing installed packages. uv may update the lockfile to match the current dependency","+declarations. uv 0.12.3 or later is required."," "," For PEP 723 scripts, set `project-manager.script = \"uv\"` in your ty configuration. ty synchronizes"," each script's environment and checks imports against its inline `dependencies` list. Declarations"],"additions":6,"deletions":6,"truncated":false},{"path":"crates/ty/src/lib.rs","lines":["@@ -30,6 +30,7 @@ use ruff_ranged_value::RangedValue;"," use salsa::Database;"," use ty_combine::Combine;"," use ty_project::metadata::Options;","+use ty_project::metadata::options::ProjectManager;"," use ty_project::metadata::settings::TerminalSettings;"," use ty_project::watch::ProjectWatcher;"," use ty_project::{","@@ -171,15 +172,13 @@ fn run_check(args: CheckCommand) -> anyhow::Result<ExitStatus> {","             ProjectMetadata::from_config_file(config_file.clone(), &project_path, &system)?","         }","         None => ProjectMetadata::discover(&project_path, &system)?,","-    }","-    .with_uv_workspace_discovery(use_uv.is_some_and(UseUv::workspace_discovery_enabled));","+    };"," ","     project_metadata.apply_configuration_files(&system)?;"," ","     let env_options = Options::from_uv_mode(use_uv.map(RangedValue::cli));","     project_metadata.set_override_options(env_options.combine(args.into_options()));","-    if project_metadata.uv_workspace_discovery_enabled()","-        && let [path] = check_paths.as_slice()","+    if let [path] = check_paths.as_slice()","         && system.is_file(path)","         && system","             .read_to_string(path)","@@ -187,10 +186,10 @@ fn run_check(args: CheckCommand) -> anyhow::Result<ExitStatus> {","     {","         // A single PEP 723 script uses its own uv environment, even with an explicit ty","         // configur